            <ArticleTitle>Clinical guidelines for managing mandibular dysfunction.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>592-7; quiz 598-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Temporomandibular disorders are a class of orofacial pain that represents a management challenge to practitioners. This article presents a definition, diagnostic classification, screening mechanism, symptomatology, and management guidelines for a sequential approach to treating temporomandibular disorder patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
